  "description": "TUnit-native OpenTelemetry distributed-tracing (Activity / span) assertions for .NET tests. Foundation release with the HasOperationName span assertion over Assert.That(activity); the full fluent surface (tags, status, parent/child, same-trace) lands in 0.1.0. Builds on the TracingAssertions framework-agnostic core. AOT-compatible, trimmable, no runtime reflection in the assertion path, and no NuGet runtime dependency.",
